{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0158_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "368f81a0a2c19d2cb5eee447a2c4910038eb4196be2ada637be349734fbbf4e6", "ja": "公演直後、アイドル達が熱気の余韻に浸って\nいると、プロデューサーが着替えを促しに来\nる。みんなが去ってから、静香はふと、相棒\nへの思いを話し始めるのだった。", "zh": "演出刚结束，偶像们正沉浸在热烈气氛的余韵中，制作人前来催促大家换装。  \n大家离开后，静香忽然开始谈起对搭档的心情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0158_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "27cc54f434c338316cbd6c03641025073db94131a35ed5469427f664421be13d", "ja": "（D/Zealのリバイバル公演が、無事に終わった。\n会場に残る熱気が、ライブの余韻を感じさせるな）", "zh": "（D/Zeal的重演公演顺利结束了。会场里还残留着的热气，让人感受到演出的余韵啊）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0158_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_05_1001_p", "source_sha256": "8a7cbba4231e7d4827bd2bb4ac9a207433a9a27bfc20608483922fcefe3d075a", "ja": "静香もジュリアも、まだ着替えてないとは……。\n舞台袖には居ないし、どこに行ったんだ？", "zh": "静香和茱莉亚居然都还没换衣服……\n舞台侧边也不在，她们去哪儿了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0158_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_05_1002_016tsu", "source_sha256": "10a4e4fb2160ff08d5fbd9ce403279544b6586289e874c78a4cd93754b2e1dce", "ja": "静香ちゃん、ジュリアーノ！　最高のライブだったよ！\nあ～あ、わたしも一緒に歌いたかったなー。", "zh": "静香，茱莉亚！刚才的演出太棒啦！啊～啊，我也好想一起唱啊——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0158_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_05_1003_015siz", "source_sha256": "63ae1d466584ec2d4003dc7e4931741462b6bfc43b0374082d40f46641390a1b", "ja": "ありがとう、翼。一緒に歌うのはまた今度ね。\n麗花さんの声援、ステージまで聞こえてましたよ。", "zh": "谢谢你，翼。一起唱歌就等下次吧。\n丽花小姐的加油声，在舞台上也听得一清二楚哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0158_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_05_1004_048rei", "source_sha256": "4329ba1c109ffba5f0736a8cb14c27a87f74b2a9a41201d17c4a451ba26a981a", "ja": "わあ～、本当に？\nそれじゃ今日の大声大賞は、私が優勝だね♪", "zh": "哇～，真的吗？\n那今天的最大声大奖，就是我拿冠军啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0158_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_05_1005_050jul", "source_sha256": "81b368b0d444f865c83104c200abdd82283a77f8bf35a1c21367a79655b5d47e", "ja": "なんだその迷惑な大賞は！", "zh": "那是什么扰民大奖啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0158_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_05_1006_p", "source_sha256": "d3546c700fdac8dd659e76f1b58e11ce981a53e2d05b697e4ecf09aaeee2c9c2", "ja": "静香、ジュリア！　ふたりとも、ここにいたのか。\nそろそろ着替えてほしいんだけど……。", "zh": "静香，茱莉亚！你们两个都在这里啊。\n差不多该去换衣服了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0158_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_05_1007_015siz", "source_sha256": "4b7af52b1af9b35e7b9d2e0002c8fdabbfb2c20070bd559b6c8d7661f6e1bee4", "ja": "あっ。", "zh": "啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0158_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_05_1008_050jul", "source_sha256": "4b7af52b1af9b35e7b9d2e0002c8fdabbfb2c20070bd559b6c8d7661f6e1bee4", "ja": "あっ。", "zh": "啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0158_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_05_1009_050jul", "source_sha256": "09ad35ce65abc24f06340317e8f37f099dc02992be403b58b3a5a5dd10cfa022", "ja": "そういや、衣装のまんまだったな。\n話が盛り上がって、すっかり忘れてたよ。", "zh": "说起来，我们还穿着演出服呢。\n聊得太起劲，都彻底忘了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0158_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_05_1010_048rei", "source_sha256": "b68b55374f8dd7d395c8fa7c22f438c3a447dfc955b2fe86753613ae6074ec27", "ja": "じゃあ、私と翼ちゃんは控え室に行ってようか？\n話の続きもしたいし♪", "zh": "那我和翼先去休息室吧？我还想继续聊刚才的话题呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0158_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_05_1011_016tsu", "source_sha256": "2fa9a7ca8cd553d787e43ab82523aef9e39c8c8b56e3271d9b19c447d23d7f2f", "ja": "やった～！　行きます行きます♪\nふたりとも、先に行ってるねー。", "zh": "太好啦～！去、马上去♪\n两位，我们先过去啰～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0158_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_05_1012_p", "source_sha256": "0c7adfdcbc02d5b08ce18a3c067effdb88bd436d989dd851c852750f632aa953", "ja": "随分、夢中になってたみたいだな。", "zh": "看来你相当投入啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0158_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_05_1013_015siz", "source_sha256": "d2a1f654888c907e4bb0dd280581dc18e688cb3f258075b225e8a5e368de7d72", "ja": "ドラマの関係者のみなさんともお話をしていたので。\n楽しんでいただけて良かったです。でも……。", "zh": "因为也和电视剧的相关人员聊了聊。\n能让您享受其中真是太好了。不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0158_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_05_1014_050jul", "source_sha256": "3ecf89ecb9c6403bd8fe8422d069a4f335745491bd817a095b4b842ef3246258", "ja": "なあ、{$P$}。チハどうした？\n客席にいたのは、なんとなく分かってたけど。", "zh": "喂，{$P$}。千早怎么了？\n我隐约知道她在观众席里。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0158_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_05_1015_p", "source_sha256": "dc1d8536b63c86bd7c66d4bce4d3f584f586448eb41ee397b68757fd309f8217", "ja": "ああ、千早なら仕事に向かったよ。\nアンコールが終わる少し前に出たんだ。", "zh": "啊，千早的话已经去工作了。\n她在返场结束前不久就离开了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0158_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_05_1016_p", "source_sha256": "f00ffdd1c14e81d16d6d758431777ee6ba11ebef4aa266fa527ad5eaa3bf16eb", "ja": "良かったって、褒めてたよ。\nそれと、いい刺激になったともね。", "zh": "她还夸你做得很好，说这给了她很好的刺激。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0158_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_05_1017_015siz", "source_sha256": "fd28e0594a66ce7e6238b9c42d69d4f0973dfba7f2fca6352b33fb8f3951a10f", "ja": "そうですか……。ふふっ。", "zh": "这样啊……呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0158_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_05_1018_050jul", "source_sha256": "a7debfdc7eda963e3fa863e78b2674e79c5ef7c92ef85f7aa57c7cae0a842636", "ja": "よかったな、シズ。\n朝から気にしてたもんな？　チハが来るかどうか。", "zh": "太好了，静。你从早上开始就在意千早会不会来，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0158_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_05_1019_015siz", "source_sha256": "a37dddabc3b81d7f37d017dbc6d11efbab7fe9cb4fe4479f3d54da04f934a311", "ja": "き、気づいてたんですか！？\nで、でもそれって……今言うことじゃないですよね？", "zh": "您、您注意到了吗！？\n但、但是那个……现在不该说这个吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0158_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_05_1020_050jul", "source_sha256": "4a9d66fad523120c0996b7fdf5a1ee150fb8156e9940abd357fac22e6603b8dd", "ja": "おっと、こうしてる場合じゃなかった。\n早く着替えに行かないとな！", "zh": "哎呀，不能继续这样磨蹭了。得赶紧去换衣服才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0158_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_05_1021_p", "source_sha256": "93a66d37a16fced6d69b602ad598c6f8975eecec58af60cfef5cc0c98b7ba192", "ja": "ははっ。静香に怒られる前に逃げたな。\nほら、静香も……。", "zh": "哈哈，在被静香骂之前就逃走了啊。\n来，静香也……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0158_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_05_1022_015siz", "source_sha256": "02f0d03d88b29c2f9a524ca402c8bfdd5ebe10e16c3e5fd3261e1a0ff22b36d4", "ja": "あっ……{$P$}。", "zh": "啊……{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0158_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_05_1023_p", "source_sha256": "18d162531d5f9652f5090e392594e21551e1fc20748023a27800d522426cc30b", "ja": "どうした？", "zh": "怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0158_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_05_1024_015siz", "source_sha256": "345f715b4512c7dbafd076550b4ab6d3defbbb64bc154619ce010c13bbf17153", "ja": "あの、ありがとうございます。\nジュリアさんと歌える機会を作ってくれて。", "zh": "那个，谢谢您。\n为我创造了能和茱莉亚小姐一起唱歌的机会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0158_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_05_1025_015siz", "source_sha256": "196f5f643603ae828bd6b5150efabbcfb4d53df67956920114046ecfff4af698", "ja": "前回の公演から、私も成長したつもりです。\n自信もついてきた……と思います。", "zh": "从上次公演之后，我觉得自己也成长了不少。\n也变得更有自信了……应该吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0158_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_05_1026_015siz", "source_sha256": "c1ad31e898ed32b4d9359f0d4001b776be0f92d617f8fa49fd7e58ba5f74a231", "ja": "だから、また一緒に歌いたいなって思ってたんです。\nジュリアさんなら、私の全力を受け止めてくれるから。", "zh": "所以，我一直想着还想再和您一起唱歌。\n因为是茱莉亚先生，能够接住我的全力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0158_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_05_1027_p", "source_sha256": "fce88315671dd1c586e9f1b8495d6018c093f32f15942aca5bfaf4d3ebce6b25", "ja": "……静香。", "zh": "……静香。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0158_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_05_1028_015siz", "source_sha256": "31f2d329424572d1011bda79483d9e7e829a37e97d7631905eb0d808003712f6", "ja": "でも、この公演ではっきりとわかりました。\nやっぱり、ジュリアさんは凄いですね……。", "zh": "但是，通过这次公演，我终于明白了。\n果然，茱莉亚先生真的很厉害呢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0158_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_05_1029_050jul", "source_sha256": "a1c1e97fec0862eea1421b409f5b0b7c5eb748a674aa5195ca8ffc07d002a53c", "ja": "おい何してるんだ、シズ？\nあっ、悪ぃ。ふたりの時間、邪魔しちまったか？", "zh": "喂，你在干什么，静香？\n啊，抱歉。是不是打扰你们两个人的时间了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0158_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_05_1030_015siz", "source_sha256": "c590e144db8b28850baed53eb1ca3f5513c77c30aa6e4bf49691b6e6bfdd832a", "ja": "ジュリアさん！？　ち、違いますから！\nもう、何ニヤニヤしてるんですか！", "zh": "茱莉亚先生！？不、不是这样的！\n真是的，您在傻笑什么呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0158_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_05_1031_015siz", "source_sha256": "c0f756468dc2c04f4c9750d48b96685144a7277bb07d25a04d68583f75cd6531", "ja": "と、とにかく！　そう、着替え！\n早く行きますよ、ジュリアさん！", "zh": "总、总之！对，换衣服！\n快点走吧，茱莉亚先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0158_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_05_1032_050jul", "source_sha256": "282260b359165bca61bacca72c0a8334f61dc8081656446323d24dd1b4f22f00", "ja": "へっ？\nあ、シズ！　待てってば！", "zh": "诶？\n啊，静香！等等我！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0158_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_05_1033_p", "source_sha256": "b77a01aea3c1d6cb8b8e1d48e8268004d80ae212c251c68a2093a6436d9046d9", "ja": "（D/Zealの熱さが、また新しい熱を作る。\nふたりにもらった熱を、俺も仕事に活かしていこう！）", "zh": "（D/Zeal的热情又创造出了新的热情。我也要把从她们那里得到的这份热情投入到工作中去！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
